Provided so that a new method can be placed on the same axes without re-running the
reference implementation. All are CSV with a header row, under `paper/tables/`.

| File | Rows | Contents |
|---|---:|---|
| `t3_01_task_f_baselines_hourly.csv` | {{rows_t3_01}} | Task F baseline ladder, hourly, by station and horizon. |
| `t3_02_task_n_baselines_hourly.csv` | {{rows_t3_02}} | Task N baseline ladder, hourly, by station, with exceedance metrics. |
| `t3_06_task_n_baselines_daily.csv` | {{rows_t3_06}} | Task N daily ladder on the learned models' evaluation rows: the table to compare a daily model against. |
| `t4_01_cams_baseline_variants.csv` | {{rows_t4_01}} | CAMS raw, locally debiased and pooled-debiased, per station. |
| `t5_01_loco_untuned.csv` | {{rows_t5_01}} | Untuned gradient boosting, leave-city-out, per fold and seed. |
